/*=============================================================================
	RockOnBlendPixelShader.usf: Our custom post process suite
=============================================================================*/ 

//@Rock - JoelS: Completely rejiggered this pass.
//- new bloom
//		|- Bloom is seperated from DOF
//		|- Bloom options. Eg, taking an approximation of kelvin temperature colour values mapped to its range.
//		|- pow() optimisation on the relevent bloom method. Limits the minimal pow range to being squared.
//- new DOF
//		|- Introduced small DOF blur for better quality. These are shared by motion blur samples.
//		|- DOF doesn't ghost on partially focused areas.
//		|- DOF respects HDR values.
//- new motion blur
//		|- Motion blur has been massively simplified to use just the velocity buffer pass.
//		|- Camera based velocity is pre-accumulated in the velocity buffer.
//		|- Motion blur mostly respects HDR values, giving more obvious light streaks.
//
//================================================================================================================================
//Includes
//================================================================================================================================
#include "PostProcessCommon.usf" // also includes Common.usf
